Package: optBuck
Title: Bucking Simulator and Bucking Analysis for Harvester Files
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lennart", "Noordermeer", email = "lennart.noordermeer@nibio.no",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000")),
    person("NIBIO", role = "cph"),
    person("SFI SmartForest", role = "fnd"))
Description: Reads StanForD 2010 harvester production files (.hpr) and product
    instructions (.pin), finds the cutting pattern that gives the highest
    value for each stem (backward induction on the stem profile), compares
    the harvester's recorded bucking with the best possible bucking, tunes
    price matrices to a target length distribution and offers a Shiny app for
    comparing two sets of assortments and prices. Norwegian national forest
    inventory trees (sanitized) and an uploaded tree list can be bucked too.
